# TEST FIXTURE (id 222): the second end of the cross-map pad of test_c6sys (contract section 46.3). The wall at i 6 splits it: the pad F (9,5) and the person (10,3) on the east side are
# reachable only through the pad of test_c6sys (4,12).
@map test_c6sys_b
@size 12 8
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill dirt_a
@spawn start 1 1 SE
@legend
  .  tile=dirt_a
  W  tile=dirt_a solid=yes
  P  tile=pad pad=yes
  N  tile=dirt_a npc=vecino text=c6sys.person face=S
@pad 9 5 -> test_c6sys 4 12 face=S
@grid
  ......W.....
  ......W.....
  ......W.....
  ......W...N.
  ......W.....
  ......W..P..
  ......W.....
  ......W.....
